{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18202160","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18202160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1820216001:0":{"text":"领主阁下为了塞涅的演出真是耗尽心思，连海歌剧院的演出海报都是请画家特制的。据说<style=\"highlight\">会在不同的月相下显现不同的风格</style>。","source_cn":"领主阁下为了塞涅的演出真是耗尽心思，连海歌剧院的演出海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43D597A35601D17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820216002:1":{"text":"哼，领主阁下还真是看重她……","source_cn":"哼，领主阁下还真是看重她……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B37694A0320EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820216003:1":{"text":"谁说不是呢。在塞涅出现之前，我可从没见过哪个亡灵能用短短几周就跻身诺珐斯的贵族阶级。","source_cn":"谁说不是呢。在塞涅出现之前，我可从没见过哪个亡灵能用短...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AED2C4831979278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820216004:1":{"text":"不过仔细想想也是。如果不是她的到来，海歌剧院的演出剧目几百年都不会有所改变。","source_cn":"不过仔细想想也是。如果不是她的到来，海歌剧院的演出剧目...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244ACD9DCB005CAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820216005:0":{"text":"不仅剧目一成不变，连演技都毫无增长……以前那些演员真该好好反省一下。","source_cn":"不仅剧目一成不变，连演技都毫无增长……以前那些演员真该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4A42D7417ED8FBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820216006:1":{"text":"我忽然有点理解领主阁下的感受了。她应该也看腻了那些老套的表演，所以才不遗余力地把塞涅留在诺珐斯吧？","source_cn":"我忽然有点理解领主阁下的感受了。她应该也看腻了那些老套...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F390A55250D79E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820216007:1":{"text":"塞涅留下来的主要原因应该是这里离耀光帝国比较近，方便偷渡者往来。","source_cn":"塞涅留下来的主要原因应该是这里离耀光帝国比较近，方便偷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D9F95CA2CF9A90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820216008:1":{"text":"如果深入班题斯，恐怕只有军队里那些骷髅用粗哑的嗓子为她鼓掌、用干枯的手掌为她喝彩了。","source_cn":"如果深入班题斯，恐怕只有军队里那些骷髅用粗哑的嗓子为她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6F9D4B5BE07E89D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:霉多琳":{"text":"霉多琳","source":"霉多琳","status":"source"},"speaker:哀沃":{"text":"哀沃","source":"哀沃","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}